      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jiyong: WDYT? I carefully log the message and don\u0027t send it to the client. There\u0027s still some risk of leaking sensitive information, but the failures here occur before the payload runs so perhaps they\u0027re not that risky.",
      "parentUuid": "aff3206b_74280ea2",
      "revId": "edd56fe63fe36a2224df47767ffca7ce1422e8f5",
