        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-12T07:56:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I am not a big fan of extending the error string with \"|\". But I fully understand the need for the detailed fail reason. \n\nCan we emit the fail reason string to the guest-side log and let the developers read the log for further analysis? Or do you want to have this even for non-debuggable VMs?",
      "parentUuid": "5d78ace9_aba70555",
      "revId": "edd56fe63fe36a2224df47767ffca7ce1422e8f5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2838852d_4ec3cfa2",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
